@baseUrl = http://localhost:5231

### Habit — full valid payload (documentation/manual-testing only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plans/generate-preview/habit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal_distance": "five_k",
  "level": "beginner",
  "days_per_week": 3,
  "unit": "km",
  "start_date": "2026-07-20",
  "preferred_days": ["mon", "wed", "sat"],
  "long_run_day": null
}

### 400 — missing required field (start_date omitted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plans/generate-preview/habit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal_distance": "five_k",
  "level": "beginner",
  "days_per_week": 3,
